==Rules==
{{StageRule|12thAnni}}

==Battleground==
*4 [[Bannerman Doge]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*2 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 28 seconds<sup>840f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Commander Face]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Bannerman Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~23.33 seconds<sup>400f~700f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 0.67 seconds<sup>20f</sup>, delay 16.67~26.67 seconds<sup>500f~800f</sup>.
**1 [[Mooth]] spawns after 1 second<sup>30f</sup>.
**4 [[Jackie Peng]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Commander Face is pretty easy to defeat, being basically just [[The Face]], but a little faster. Spam meatshields and tankers like [[Mythical Titan Cat]] and [[Whale Cat]] to beat this stage easily.

==Trivia==
*Ogo Domain is named after the Japanese word 大湖 ''taiko'' (great lake). One of the ''[[wikipedia:Kanji#Kun'yomi (native reading)|kun]]'' readings of 大 is ''ō'', and ''[[wikipedia:Rendaku|rendaku]]'' causes 湖 to be read as ''go'' instead of ''ko''.

